{c: Verse 1}
[F#m]Dilbar [D]mere kab [F#m]tak mujhe
[F#m]Aise [E]hi tadpaoge
[D]Main aag dil [E]mein lagga dunga woh
[C#]Ki pal [F#m]mein pighal jaoge
[F#]Ik [B]din aayega [F#]pyaar [B]ho jayega
[D]Main aag dil [E]mein lagga dunga woh
[C#]Ki pal [F#m]mein pighal jaoge
[F#m]Sochoge jab mere [B]baare mein tanhayon me
